WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:02.580
Our character has started to hollow

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.200
and it all started with Yoel

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.040
As I have said: I was once

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:47.900
a sorcerer, alas the magic of Londor
is a far cry from the wonders of Vinheim.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.840
But I can teach you what I know...

00:00:55.880 --> 00:01:00.580
I believe that I can help tease out your true strength.

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:05.580
We Pilgrims of Londor are keenly aware

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:33.640
So, drawing out your true strength at Yoel yields you a level, completely for free without any soul

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:39.710
requirement, however it also subtly and
without any notification creates a Dark Sigil

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:42.750
found within your key slot in your
inventory.

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.200
The Dark Sigil description reads:

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:50.420
"A black gaping hole in the flesh that
resembles the brand of an undead, the

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:55.040
darkness of humanity seeps from this
bottomless pitch black hole, the gap

00:01:55.040 --> 00:02:01.440
filled by the accumulation of the curse"
and once this dark sigil appears and is

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:07.440
triggered by Yoel, every subsequent death
will cause you to hollow further and you can

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:12.450
now track the level of your hollowing on
your stats screen. This dark sigil will never

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:19.070
heal but there is a tale told of a firekeeper who
returned from the abyss and brought

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:24.230
great comfort to a bearer of the curse.
After getting twenty thousand souls you

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:28.870
can buy the tower key from the Handmaiden
and then you can explore the Bell Tower

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:35.269
behind Firelink Shrine. We journey up there
and we find what remains of this old,

00:02:35.269 --> 00:02:42.519
legendary fire keeper. Soul of a fire keeper, who is said to
have returned from the abyss, this fire

00:02:42.519 --> 00:02:47.340
keeper preserves the bonfire and serves
its champion, she is said to have soothed

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:53.239
and accepted the Dark Sigil which has
tainted her soul and yet her soul will one

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:58.620
day in bed itself in the bosom of
another fire keeper. The tower key reads,

00:02:58.620 --> 00:03:05.870
"The bell tower is the grave firekeepers past, when a firekeeper has served her purpose, she is led to..."

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:09.650
"true darkness, where she enjoys a long
deserved sleep."

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:11.860
As we journeyed down, I got

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:16.260
really lucky. I looked over the edge here
and I saw that a corpse had been thrown

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:21.320
down here but it got caught on the edge
and it's another fire keeper.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:25.460
And below, are hundreds more.

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:30.080
This, apparently, is the fate of fire keepers who serve the flame.

00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:32.960
The fire keepers were robbed of light to

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:38.660
better serve as vessels for souls. Only
those who cherish the writhing, searing

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:44.340
darkness were given the fire keeper's
black attire. The Estus Ring, reads,

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:50.900
"This ring was entrusted to a certain fire keeper, but in
the end, she never met her champion, and..."

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:56.510
"The ensuing tragic farce became a
favorite tale of the masses." I hope you

00:03:56.510 --> 00:04:01.970
guys are keeping up with me. This is a
really lore-heavy episode and apparently

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:06.950
this fire keeper who returned from the
abyss existed during Ludleth of

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:10.820
Coreland's cycle. Before he linked the fire,
presumably.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:10.080
There's a story here for sure... But, parts
are missing. Who did Coreland seek to

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:15.919
spare her from? Who was the betrayer? And,
what did this fire keeper who returned

00:05:15.919 --> 00:05:18.499
from the Abyss, apparently, see?

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:53.780
Healing the Dark Sigil costs a ridiculous amount of
souls and even after its removed, your

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:58.150
points of hollowing still remain and
there is always the option to acquire

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:03.520
more Dark Sigils from Yoel. As far as I
can tell, the only effect of hollowing

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:07.620
is that it allows you to occasionally
acquire another dark sigil from Yoel,

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:12.490
and this lets you level up for free, so
in a sense it's a way to lessen the pain

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:16.949
of dying so many times, this is the best
theory I have and I've gone

00:06:16.949 --> 00:06:21.750
painstakingly over every piece of
footage I have. But there's more because

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:28.190
of the 5 free levels and five Dark Sigils,
Yoel says you have attained ample

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:31.470
strength and that soon all will become
clear.

00:06:32.360 --> 00:06:38.229
And then, after reloading the area,
watching over Yoel's newfound corpse was a

00:06:38.229 --> 00:06:39.589
woman named Yuria.

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:32.140
The notable items she sells are the Purging

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:37.550
Stone, which seems to say that it will
cure the visual effects of hollowing and

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:42.100
the dark hand from Dark Souls one.
There's also two rings the change you into

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:48.100
human or phantom form and the Londor
Braille Divine Tome, which teaches us

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:53.220
dark miracles, if we can find someone to read
it, and... I know where to find her.

00:08:15.889 --> 00:08:21.900
Siegmeier and Andre, they aren't the only souls to
be reborn this man from Carim, just

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:27.060
quoted a line from Lautrec, of Dark Souls
one and both of them are obsessed with

00:08:27.060 --> 00:08:27.920
the firekeepers.

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:42.640
Irina, unwillingly, eventually reads the braille tome to us and she can teach us three hexes. Hexes are confirmed.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:46.100
Dark Blade, Vow of Silence, and Dead Again.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:49.380
Isn't it better to burn a Soul Vessel than to be a dirty hexer scum?

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:50.760
"Maybe I can try a Dex build."

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:56.280
So, around this point, I started feeling really pressured, I knew
I was at the end of my pre-release

00:09:56.280 --> 00:10:01.210
session with Dark Souls 3 so, in a last
ditch effort to just to learn something

00:10:01.210 --> 00:10:04.510
more, I kill everyone I can think of in
the Shrine.

00:10:04.510 --> 00:10:06.400
Arine drops the tower key, and

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:14.010
then her prior captor makes good on his promise and he ambushes
you in the shrine for killing her. You get his

00:10:14.010 --> 00:10:19.160
hammer and his shield when you kill him.
The Handmaiden respawns but every time

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:24.100
you kill her, she increases the prices of
her wares in revenge. I think the tower key

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:31.110
ended up costing like 40,000 instead of 20,000, it
was insane. Don't do this. Andre... Does not

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:34.930
give a shit when you attack him. I guess
he's been blacksmithing for like

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:40.650
generations and he's been smithing stuff
through countless apocalypses, 1 undead

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:44.730
slashing at him isn't going to stop him.
Though when you do kill him, he refuses

00:10:44.730 --> 00:10:47.730
to help you at all so don't do this
either.

00:10:51.610 --> 00:10:53.830
And finally we killed Yuria.

00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:14.280
I found it interesting that she shares her name with "Yuria" of Demon Souls.

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:20.100
Who, in that game was a witch who practiced
the dark arts that stem from emotion. I

00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:25.890
always remember that bit of dialogue and it's
interesting, Yuria of Dark Souls 3 has

00:11:25.890 --> 00:11:32.220
connections to hexes and dark miracles
that also reference emotion in many

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:33.880
descriptions.

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:47.500
Kathe. This makes it click with us that Londor is
New Londo from Dark Souls one. A land where the

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:51.779
Four Kings were corrupted by the way
whisperings of Kathe the home of the dark

00:11:51.779 --> 00:11:56.959
wraithes, who look to be ruled over by a
Darklord which lines up with the end of

00:11:56.959 --> 00:12:02.690
Dark Souls 1, as you become a dark lord
who embraces the curse, a Lordof Hollows.

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:08.209
So much more to talk about but no time.
The final boss of the demo is the Cursed

00:12:08.209 --> 00:12:12.529
Greatwood. I don't know about others,
but this fight was really disappointing

00:12:12.529 --> 00:12:17.880
for me. His attacks did really low damage
for how easy they were to avoid. However,

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:22.120
he does drop something hugely important.
He drops a transposing kiln.

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:40.310
The most interesting item here is the
Black Eye Ring I think because it gives

00:12:40.310 --> 00:12:44.980
you health back on successive hits which
means it encourages more aggressive play

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:50.660
style which is awesome. The demo ends with
another fight against a Boreal Knight and

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:55.779
this one is down the elevator where we
first met Siegward, the crestfallen

00:12:55.779 --> 00:13:01.800
knight calls this path the path to
Aldrich, Saint of the Deep, there is a lot

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:07.899
more I want to talk about, and I wish I wasn't under time
constraints because come March 24th, I'll

00:13:07.899 --> 00:13:12.300
be able to do a much better job than
what I have done here and that's going

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:17.670
to be exciting. March 24th is when the
Japanese version releases by the way but

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:21.519
for now this is all I have to show. I
really did try my best with all this.

00:13:21.519 --> 00:13:27.600
I only got four hours of sleep every night
so thank you all for watching, so much and I'll see

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:29.340
you again soon. Time for sleep.

